id=theettam_tweaks
name=Theettam Tweaks
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=Mohithash
description=Modular, reversible battery/performance tweaks for Theettam Kernel. Independent toggles in tweaks.conf: screen-off wakelock trip (data-path only; calls/alarms/paging untouched), VM+I/O tuning, and battery/balanced/performance profiles. Everything reverts on uninstall + reboot. The trip lever needs a kernel with CONFIG_BOEFFLA_WL_BLOCKER (Theettam has it).
